<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/5/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended in section 91 by inserting after the word \"assets\" the words \"as provided for in subsection 3(lA), or by virtue of the vesting of the property, rights and liabilities of the Board as provided for in section 90A\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/5/eng@> .
